                    title={p.video.title}
                    class="smc-lite-yt"
                  ></lite-youtube>
                </div>
              )}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8. Sell Your Vintage Guitar Collection Online + Meet Joe -->
  <section class="smc-meet-wrap">
    <div class="smc-meet-cta">
      <div class="smc-inner smc-meet-cta__grid">
        <h2 class="smc-meet-cta__title">
          <span class="smc-meet-cta__accent">Sell Your Vintage</span> Guitar Collection Online
        </h2>
        <a href="/contact-me/" class="smc-btn smc-btn--cream">Contact Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="smc-inner smc-meet">
      <div class="smc-meet__video">
        <lite-youtube
          videoid="zMd6IJ-6e-8"
          params="wmode=transparent&autoplay=1&enablejsapi=1&rel=0&modestbranding=1"
          title="Meet Vintage Guitar Buyer, Joe Dampt"
          class="smc-lite-yt"
        ></lite-youtube>
      </div>
      <div class="smc-meet__panel">
        <h2 class="smc-meet__title">Meet Vintage Guitar Buyer, <span>Joe Dampt</span></h2>
        <h3 class="smc-meet__sub">Professional Buyer And Seasoned Collector Of Vintage Guitars</h3>
        <p>Hey there! My name is Joe Dampt and I love old music and old guitars!</p>
        <p>I fell in love with the guitar as a youngster while listening to old music from the 50s and 60s. From then on, music has been my life, and I’ve sacrificed and worked hard to make music and musical instruments my livelihood. I love old guitars and musical instruments, but I love the MUSIC even more. I believe that guitars don’t do us any good if they just sit in a case. These beauties are meant to be played!</p>
        <p>I’ve performed in many local bands and my favorite styles to play are classic country/western music, swing & dance music, and classic rock & roll.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* 9. FAQs: shared <FAQ /> component (wood-textured cream box pattern).
